From aae51c7d0274f8d610348a04caac7d778af5aac3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AegisOS Build <build@aegisos.local>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 03:29:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] aegisos: move credential_capture flag override to the release
 config this product actually reads

Task 2 of the duress decoy switch plan placed this override under
aconfig/trunk_staging/android.multiuser/, but
sdk_phone64_x86_64-cp2a-userdebug (and lynx-cur-userdebug, same
RELEASE_ACONFIG_VALUE_SETS list) both build against release config
cp2a, which only globs aconfig/cp2a/*/Android.bp value sets and never
reads trunk_staging/. The flag therefore had no on-device storage slot
at all (confirmed via 'adb shell aflags list'), leaving the
skip-keyguard-on-decoy-switch fix permanently inactive and reproducing
the double-PIN-entry bug it exists to fix (Task 10 report, Step 2).

aconfig/cp2a/android.multiuser/Android.bp already globs
*_flag_values.textproto, so no Android.bp change is needed - only
moving the file to the directory this product's release config
actually consumes.
---
 .../android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto    | 0
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename aconfig/{trunk_staging => cp2a}/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto (100%)

diff --git a/aconfig/trunk_staging/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto b/aconfig/cp2a/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto
similarity index 100%
rename from aconfig/trunk_staging/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto
rename to aconfig/cp2a/android.multiuser/credential_capture_flag_values.textproto
-- 
2.39.5

